|---|---|
| **File** | `recipe/instructions/sub_mas-pre-push-validator.md` |
| **Error** | Check 8 calls `dev_goose_expert_check.py --check-mechanism "$(git diff ...)"` — when `git diff` is empty, script runs with empty string → usage error → false positive blocked |
| **Fix** | Add conditional: `if [ -n "$DIFF_CONTENT" ]` before calling, otherwise default to current findings/patches |
| **Status** | ⏳ Documented, not applied |

### 🔴 E2 — goose-expert Not Registered as Delegable Source
