| **Impact** | Every pipeline run gets `⛔ FAILING TO SUMMON GOOSE-EXPERT = validation is REJECTED` — but validation passes because the condition can't be enforced |
| **Fix** | Register `sub_mas-goose-expert.yaml` in `recipe/dev-mas-engineer.yaml` sub_recipes |
| **Status** | ⏳ Systemic issue since goose-expert was created but never wired in |

### 🟡 E3 — Consumer-Recipes Wrong Director References (R51)
| Field | Value |
|---|---|
