| **Error** | After NN1 splits, consumer recipes still reference old direct sub-recipes (e.g., `test-reporter`) instead of the new directors (e.g., `test-reporter-director`) |
| **Impact** | Subagent delegation may bypass orchestrator, breaking the intended hierarchy |
| **Status** | ⏳ Documented in `findings_R51_consumer.yaml` |

### 🟡 E4 — dev_fast_scan.py Path Resolution Bug
